@AuthService.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:8081

### Registro
POST {{AuthService.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hiker@peaker.io",
  "username": "hiker",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery-staple"
}

### Inicio de sesión con correo
POST {{AuthService.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "hiker@peaker.io",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery-staple"
}

### Inicio de sesión con nombre de usuario
POST {{AuthService.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "hiker",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery-staple"
}

### Clave pública (JWKS)
GET {{AuthService.API_HostAddress}}/.well-known/jwks.json
Accept: application/json

